{"sections":[{"slug":"扭结–素数类比","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"扭结–素数类比"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">扭结</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">素数类比</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"扭结–素数类比"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">球面</span> $S^3$</td><td>$\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">扭结</span> $C$</td><td><span lang=\"zh\">素数</span> $p$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$\\pi_1(S^3)=1$</td><td>$\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z})=1$<br>(<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/GrothendieckGalois理论","text":"Grothendieck Galois <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":")</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$H^3(S^3,\\mathbb{Z})=\\mathbb{Z}$</td><td>$H^3(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z},\\mathbb G_m)=\\mathbb{Q}/\\mathbb{Z}$<br>("},{"Local":{"url":"/平展上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":")</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span> $C\\hookrightarrow S^3$</td><td>$\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb F_p \\to \\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">补空间</span> $S^3-C$</td><td>$\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[1/p]$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$\\pi_1(S^3-C)^{\\mathrm{ab}}=\\mathbb{Z}$</td><td>$\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[1/p])^{\\mathrm{ab}} = \\mathbb{Z}_p^\\times$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$\\pi_1(C_1)\\to\\pi_1(S^3-C_2)^{\\mathrm{ab}}$</td><td>$\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb F_p) \\to \\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[1/q])^{\\mathrm{ab}}$</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">两个扭结</span> $C_1,C_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">的卷绕数</span></td><td>$p\\in\\mathbb{Z}_q^\\times$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}]}}}]}